WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Going slowly is not the same as standing still.. Today's twenty minutes beat

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
tomorrow's two hours.. No comparison. Race your own record.. Resting is part of

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
the programme.. Mastery hides inside boring repetition.. Words are waiting for

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
you; go and take them.. No panic: each question is just one question.. Words

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
today, sentences tomorrow, freedom after.. Only your speed changes, never the

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
destination.. You grow exactly where it is hard..
